{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20073","headline":"至孝义渡寄郑军事唐二十五 · 孟郊","name":"至孝义渡寄郑军事唐二十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"咫尺不得见，心中空嗟嗟。\n官街泥水深，下脚道路斜。\n嵩少玉峻峻，伊雒碧华华。\n岸亭当四迥，诗老独一家。\n洧叟何所如，郑石唯有些。\n何当来说事，爲君开流霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20073.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20073","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}